sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant FastAPI
    participant DataReader
    participant Cache
    participant GoogleSheets
    participant RulesEngine

    User->>Browser: Open dashboard for account
    Browser->>FastAPI: GET /dashboard/{account_id}
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Auth middleware (check session)
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Set tenant context (org_id)
    FastAPI->>Browser: HTML shell (Jinja2 template)

    Browser->>FastAPI: GET /api/chart-data/{account_id}?start=X&end=Y
    FastAPI->>DataReader: read_analytics_sheet(account)
    DataReader->>Cache: Check cache file (60-min TTL)

    alt Cache is fresh
        Cache-->>DataReader: Cached row data
    else Cache is stale or missing
        DataReader->>GoogleSheets: get_all_values() from ANALYTICS worksheet
        GoogleSheets-->>DataReader: Raw rows (headers + data)
        DataReader->>DataReader: enrich_all() (compute Hook Rate, CVR, AOV, etc.)
        DataReader->>Cache: Write new cache file
    end

    DataReader->>DataReader: apply_date_filter(start, end)
    DataReader->>RulesEngine: evaluate_all_adsets(rows, rules, business_type)
    RulesEngine->>RulesEngine: group_by_adset()
    RulesEngine->>RulesEngine: evaluate each ad set (proprietary)
    RulesEngine-->>DataReader: Ad set rows with rule_flag

    DataReader->>DataReader: get_kpi_summary() with period comparison
    DataReader->>DataReader: get_daily_trend()
    DataReader->>DataReader: get_funnel_data() with leakage detection
    DataReader->>DataReader: get_heatmap_data()
    DataReader->>DataReader: get_platform_breakdown()
    DataReader-->>FastAPI: Full JSON payload

    FastAPI-->>Browser: JSON (KPIs, charts, flags, table)
    Browser->>Browser: Render Chart.js charts
    Browser->>Browser: Render KPI cards with change indicators
    Browser->>Browser: Render filtered ad table
    User->>Browser: Apply filter or change date range
    Browser->>FastAPI: POST /api/dashboard/{account_id}/data (with filters)
    FastAPI-->>Browser: Filtered JSON payload
